            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ms Diana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very basic and easy. I made it with frozen strawberries and blueberries, peach juice instead of orange juice. Cut the ingredients in half for one serving size and it was perfect.",
