              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elvira Silva"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good! Didn't have the yogurt but all my fruit was frozen wich made it really thick, just how we like it I also added 1 tblsp. of ground flax seed. Thanks CindyT. for sumitting your recipe. Elvira Silva.",
            "datePublished": "2015-10-24T14:02:13.960Z"
