            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "katyggls"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really good. I scaled the recipe down by half, which said it made 3 servings, but it was more like two. I used Orange-Pineapple juice instead of OJ and Pineapple juice separately, and I used frozen banana instead of fresh to make it a little thicker. I also added a little extra banana because when I blended it up at first, it seemed a bit too thin. But other than that, everything was the same. Great flavor and no extra sugar or sweetener needed, in my opinion.",
            "datePublished": "2014-09-28T16:56:53.733Z"
          },
